{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_03_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_03",
  "title": "思わぬ旅",
  "storyCode": "GT-3",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b8becbf91e6ea163776183caf635e1ac9d62210fd3e2f5459780b400fe9027bc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なんとか突破した！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ボブおじさん、大丈――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "えっ？　脚の傷口のそれは――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あそこに討ち漏らした連中が居るぞ！　ワグニスク団の奴らかもしれん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これぐらい自分でなんとかなる。まずは敵を片付けよう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "わかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "うん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "このチビ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "お、おい、なんだその顔は……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "く、来るな。蜂の巣にされてぇのか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金稼ぎ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あぁ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これは……君一人で片づけたのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "うん。そうだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "驚いたな。その小さい体でよくここまで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そこに座ってじっとしてて。包帯巻くから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なんてことないさ。起こしてもらえるか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ダメだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……さっき、見たんだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "うん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私の身体の結晶を見たなら分かっているはずだ！　君も感染したいのか！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者を救うのが、あたしたちロドスの仕事だから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ロドス……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "キャロル",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ロドスって……？　ヴィクトリアじゃないの……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "元々はヴィクトリアの騎馬警官だったけど、今はロドスってところのオペレーターなんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "キャロル嬢ちゃんも離れた方がいい。私は感染者なんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "キャロル",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "キャロル、少なくとも血は見ないほうがいいよ、下がってて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よし、血は止まったよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "いつも感染者をこうやって助けているのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怖くないのか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あたしの仲間にも、感染者はたくさんいるけど、感染者かどうかなんて、普段はよく見ないと分からないし、誰が感染してるかなんて考えたことないよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ほう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "グラニ",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "まぁ、お風呂の時には、さすがにわかるけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――フッ。そうか…。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ありがとう、差別の心なきお嬢さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ビッグ・ボブ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "aliases": [
